s","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-multitape-language-equivalence</span><span>73-theorem-4.2</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>机器类及其语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d6fc09d256b74a33\" href=\"?note=d6fc09d256b74a33\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm\">73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6759b2502900015f\" href=\"?note=6759b2502900015f\" title=\"73-df-enumerable-language-notation\">73-df-enumerable-language-notation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{multi}}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{multi}}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d6fc09d256b74a33\" href=\"?note=d6fc09d256b74a33\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm\">73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm</a> 的多带机类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{multi}\">\\(\\mathrm{multi}\\)</span> 为机器模型的角色下标；其输入字母表固定为上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in \\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{multi}}\\;L=L(M)\\}=\\mathrm{RE}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in \\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{multi}}\\;L=L(M)\\}=\\mathrm{RE}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm","status":"resolved","id":"d6fc09d256b74a33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-enumerable-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6759b2502900015f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-enumerable-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-multitape-dtm-language-simulation","status":"resolved","id":"f900d02215c06646","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-multitape-dtm-language-simulation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm","status":"resolved","id":"d6fc09d256b74a33","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"机器类及其语言见 [[73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm]]；$\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[73-df-enumerable-language-notation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-enumerable-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6759b2502900015f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"机器类及其语言见 [[73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm]]；$\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[73-df-enumerable-language-notation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm","status":"resolved","id":"d6fc09d256b74a33","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{multi}}$ 使用 [[73-df-eight-tuple-multitape-tm]] 的多带机类，$\\mathrm{multi}$ 为机器模型的角色下标；其输入字母表固定为上述 $\\Sigma$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{multi}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{multi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in \\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{multi}}\\;L=L(M)\\}=\\mathrm{RE}","display":true}],"bytes":1293,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["d6fc09d256b74a33","6759b2502900015f","f900d02215c06646","0a6da8c909717780"]}